window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Five alien rebels.<br> Five women snatched from Earth.</b></p> <p>Step into a captivating world of alien romance and adventure with the thrilling box set of the Captured by Aliens series.</p> <p>Book 1: <i>Xul</i> sets the stage with Athena awakening in what seems like a hellish nightmare—an alien slave ship, where her choices are grim: mate, become a sex slave, or face death. Desperation for freedom leads her to Xul, a handsome rogue alien with his own problems and a heart he dare not open. As they embark on a journey fraught with danger and passion, Athena finds herself irresistibly drawn to Xul, but can love truly blossom amidst the stars?</p> <p>Book 2: Meet Piper in <i>Crex</i>, a fierce and independent human who finds herself stranded on an alien slave ship, facing an unimaginable fate. Her cellmate is a lethal creature with a cold heart, and despite the odds, she can't help but feel a connection. Falling for an alien killing machine was never part of her plan, but neither was abduction from Earth. With steamy scenes and an enthralling plot, <i>Crex</i> promises to keep you on the edge of your seat.</p> <p>Book 3: A desert planet becomes the battleground in <i>Yce</i> as a Diana is unexpectedly thrust into a fight for survival. Her only companion, Yce, is an enigmatic alien who both infuriates and intrigues her. Hate turns to something unexpected, and their journey becomes a test of survival and trust in a harsh, unforgiving environment.</p> <p>Book 4: In <i>Kyris</i>, emotions run deep as Kyris faces a challenging mission to protect a single human female. He's rescued countless slaves before, but none have stirred feelings within him like she does. Torn between duty and forbidden desire, Kyris battles his own demons as he fights to keep her safe.</p> <p>Book 5: Evren's life takes an unexpected turn in <i>Kyro</i> when she's kidnapped by aliens and now finds herself living on a base full of rebels. Drawn to the enigmatic Kyro, she must navigate her</p>"; 
